solution.p:
The opposite action to addition is subtraction.
\begin{aligned}
{{\frac{8}{3}}+Z} \amp= {{\frac{10}{9}}}\\
{{\frac{8}{3}}+Z}\subtractright{{{\frac{8}{3}}}} \amp= {{\frac{10}{9}}}\subtractright{{{\frac{8}{3}}}}\\
Z \amp= {-{\frac{14}{9}}}
\end{aligned}
The solution set is {\left\{\frac{-14}{9}\right\}}\text{.}

